        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Silk programme for a command performance of <i>The Poor Gentleman</i>, and <i>The Review, or, Wags of Windsor</i>, starring John Fawcett (1768-1837), Theatre Royal, Windsor, 27 June 1803."@en ;
